{"strings": [
  {"text":"FILE No. 0417","translation":"檔案編號 0417","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/desk.js"},
  {"text":"UNDER OBSERVATION","translation":"觀察中","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/desk.js"},
  {"text":"CASE FILES","translation":"個案檔案","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/deskfront.js"},
  {"text":"Dr I. V. Strogova","translation":"I. V. 斯特羅戈娃醫師","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/nameplate.js"},
  {"text":"psychotherapist","translation":"心理治療師","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/nameplate.js"},
  {"text":"ONE AT A TIME","translation":"一次一張","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/tissues.js"},
  {"text":"it's just a mirror","translation":"這只是一面鏡子","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"EXIT","translation":"出口","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"only after the session","translation":"僅限會談結束後","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"YOUR FEELINGS MATTER*","translation":"你的感受很重要*","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"*and will be noted","translation":"*並且會被記錄下來","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/elements/wall.js"},
  {"text":"Dr Strogova's Office","translation":"斯特羅戈娃醫師的診間","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"Make yourself comfortable. As far as that's possible.","translation":"請放輕鬆。在可能的範圍內。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"Sit down. The armchair is exactly where it should be.","translation":"坐吧。扶手椅就放在它該在的位置。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json captions[0] text"},
  {"text":"Your file is already open. It's thicker than you thought.","translation":"你的檔案已經打開了。比你想像的還要厚。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json captions[1] text"},
  {"text":"Tissues: one at a time. That is part of the therapy too.","translation":"面紙：一次一張。這也是治療的一部分。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/scene.json captions[2] text"},
  {"text":"The clock on the wall says ten to three: the session's time is up.","translation":"牆上的時鐘指著兩點五十分：會談時間到了。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/script.js"},
  {"text":"The page in the file is full: the doctor has written it from top to bottom.","translation":"檔案的這一頁寫滿了：醫師從頭到尾寫得密密麻麻。","where":"worlds/evil-therapist/scenes/dr-strogova-office/script.js"}
]}
